{"time": 1755436225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153611812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“一如既往的平凡早晨啊”"}
{"time": 1755436338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1884018430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“人们和过去的几年里的每一天一样，重复着相同的生活。喜怒哀乐，他们在自己的小世界里度过独特而又普通的日常”"}
{"time": 1755436368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022093344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“他们不知道这个世界的暗流。但是也不再需要了。”"}
{"time": 1755436437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1625544815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“今天之后，有一些东西消失了，但他们的一切都不会改变”"}
