{"time": 1755573380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295661873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "（唉唉）"}
{"time": 1755573445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706731770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”说起来，master刚刚一直盯着那个广告。“"}
{"time": 1755573456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632344468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”对占卜很很感兴趣吗？“"}
{"time": 1755573566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "508584445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“很感兴趣不至于  但是有点意思是真的”"}
{"time": 1755573576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1870383734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“不急”"}
{"time": 1755573610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523604699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "*尝试抓住从者的手腕"}
{"time": 1755573617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1886909457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”好吧~“"}
{"time": 1755573627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172900069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "（但是很显然  什么也抓不到）"}
{"time": 1755573632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740704643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“。。。。。？”"}
{"time": 1755573647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "333937020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=523604699]#你的手从中穿过，什么也没碰到"}
{"time": 1755573684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "327764434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“你是。。。。？”"}
{"time": 1755573691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1502695880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”啊嘞，master想要享用我的身体吗？“"}
{"time": 1755573696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "902092959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“鬼魂吗”"}
{"time": 1755573711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1212614659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”哈哈，很可惜，我没有那种东西哦“"}
{"time": 1755573732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50929154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#脸上挂起一副略显诡异的微笑"}
{"time": 1755573757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428860174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=902092959]”并非鬼魂“"}
{"time": 1755573775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1263802924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“那是。。。。？”"}
{"time": 1755573781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549608742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”你可以理解为，那个……梦境行者啦“"}
{"time": 1755573801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "748781283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“事到如今，你也该表明身份了吧”"}
{"time": 1755573844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800129284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“做个正式的自我介绍吧”"}
{"time": 1755573953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "900776052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”呃，身份吗？“"}
{"time": 1755573962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122610322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”我是不太理解人类所赋予的这种东西啦。因为，我常常扮演着各种各样的东西呢“"}
{"time": 1755573997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "476131881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“如果你需要一个定义的话。或许，可以叫我，‘梦魇’？”"}
{"time": 1755574081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751175648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“梦魇吗，那还真是，出乎意料呢”"}
{"time": 1755574156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369611201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“那你身为梦魇，要如何干涉现世的战争？”"}
{"time": 1755574217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1796468152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“不对哦，干涉现世的战争并非我的目的，而是手段”"}
{"time": 1755574261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096587540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“那你的目的是？”"}
{"time": 1755574261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "562359222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“毕竟，圣杯所能实现的，不只是现世的愿望呢”"}
{"time": 1755574302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2030113898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2096587540]“怎么说呢……让大家，睡个好觉？”"}
{"time": 1755574304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367942111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#吐舌头"}
{"time": 1755574340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061008835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“梦魇的睡个好觉吗？”"}
{"time": 1755574351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693288551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“那还真是，挺有意思的”"}
{"time": 1755574396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795500602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“那么，master呢？你的愿望是什么？”"}
{"time": 1755574597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682549767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“魔术危害人间久矣。战争，混乱，垄断，无数灾难因此而起。本应中立的魔法在一代代的垄断传承之下已经成为危害人世间的屠刀。而我要做的，便是用圣杯的力量结束这一切”"}
{"time": 1755574677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367569249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（我是来结束这一切的.jpg)"}
{"time": 1755574754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1423946986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（原来是黄巢）"}
{"time": 1755574793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2019898323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“真是伟大的想法呢。”"}
{"time": 1755574795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159381821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“不过，即使魔法不为人所用，人类就会停止互相残杀吗？"}
{"time": 1755574911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1548966679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“难道因为人类会彼此残杀，就什么都不做袖手旁观吗？”"}
{"time": 1755574931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248258084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“并不是所有人都应该承受苦难”"}
{"time": 1755574998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972283080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”不，我的意思是说“"}
{"time": 1755574999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844855104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”你应该许一个更切实际的愿望，而不是将过错归咎于魔法呢“"}
{"time": 1755575088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875233811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“将人类的天性改变吗”"}
{"time": 1755575113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698317092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“被改变天性的人类，还是原来的人类吗？”"}
{"time": 1755575119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871122363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”谁知道呢？“"}
{"time": 1755575247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52811775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”哎呀，与其纠结于这些，不如躺下来睡个觉呢“"}
{"time": 1755575248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568883978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”反正，梦中没有灾难，没有苦痛，也不会死。“"}
{"time": 1755575334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936481716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“因为，梦是你所掌握的国度？”"}
{"time": 1755575338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1491197717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "*笑笑"}
{"time": 1755575413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810218722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”不是的“"}
{"time": 1755575425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774402314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”应该说，‘梦，是我所存在的国度’才对啊“"}
{"time": 1755575567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325975113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“那你在梦的国度，又要怎么干涉现实的战争？”"}
{"time": 1755575676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "988229463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“这个简单嘛”"}
{"time": 1755575678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1006021457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“向人们发一封来自梦境的邀请函，来我这里做客就行了”"}
{"time": 1755575740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54394840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“你能把人带到梦中？有意思”"}
{"time": 1755575748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747988807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“那么继续。除此之外呢”"}
{"time": 1755575862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1100536201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“窥见酣眠者的记忆算吗？毕竟日有所思，夜有所梦。”"}
{"time": 1755576198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "175006485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“倒也不错”"}
{"time": 1755576254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299188212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“那么，你在梦境中的战斗会对现实有所影响吗？我能否参与梦境的战斗之中？我在现实的战斗你又可否参与？”"}
{"time": 1755577160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282768465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1299188212]”哎呀，好多问题啊。我一一回答吧“"}
{"time": 1755577162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1672147167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”首先，梦境中受到的伤害会等量映射到现实中——这个算是圣杯战争所给予我的权能吧。关于第二个问题，只要master在一定范围内和别人一起入眠，当然就可以参与啦。最后，我基本上没办法直接参与现实中的战斗，不过可以稍微干扰敌人的思维，影响他们的动作，这就是极限了吧。“"}
{"time": 1755579977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069646709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=738495187]（我嘞个毛玉牛乳）"}
{"time": 1755589183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658010250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（then？）"}
{"time": 1755589528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "387258120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“啧啧，也行吧”"}
{"time": 1755589556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414552629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“看来，大部分事情还是要我自己干啊”"}
{"time": 1755590111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704070835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "(还在次吗）"}
{"time": 1755590229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145735428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "（没end就是次吧）"}
{"time": 1755590235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857388756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056339614", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”master有什么目的地吗？现在要去哪儿？“"}
